/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>请登</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>录</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>申请系统</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>（</span></span></font></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span><font><span><a href=\"https://maapply.phbs.pku.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://maapply.phbs.pku.edu.cn</span></a></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>）</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>，在线申请并提交上述材料</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span></p><p><span><span>申请截止时间为<span>2025年6月6日（星期五）</span>。论坛资格审核工作将由本次论坛组委会专家组负责，参会名单将于6月中下旬以邮件形式通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>项目简介</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>本年度将有以下项目开放，各项目具体要求如下：</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>北京大学经济学-新加坡国立大学金融工程双硕士：</span></strong></span><span><span>申请人须对经济学科有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的数理分析能力。本项目也欢迎本科为非经济、管理、金融类专业的理工科学生申请。同时，需执行新加坡国立大学的相关程序。</span></span></p></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>北京大学管理学-新加坡国立大学金融工程双硕士：</span></strong></span><span><span>申请人对管理学科有浓厚兴趣。本项目也欢迎本科为非经济、管理、金融类专业的理工科学生申请。同时，需执行新加坡国立大学的相关程序。</span></span></p></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>金融项目（金融管理方向）：</span></strong></span><span><span>申请人须对金融学科有浓厚兴趣，且学习过主要的经济学、金融学课程，并有较强的数理分析能力。</span></span></p></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>金融项目（国际金融管理方向）：</span></strong></span><span><span>申请人对金融学科有浓厚兴趣，且学习过主要的经济学、金融学课程，有较强的数理分析能力，对赴北京大学英国校区参加为期一年的课程学习与海外交流有着强烈的意愿和兴趣。</span></span></p></section><section><strong><span>04</span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>金融项目（数量与金融科技方向）：</span></strong></span><span><span>申请人对金融学科有浓厚兴趣，本项目只接收本科为经济学或数学、统计、计算机等数理基础较强的理工科学生。</span></span></p></section><section><strong><span>05</span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>金融项目（金融投资方向）：</span></strong></span><span><span>申请人对金融学科有浓厚兴趣，本项目只接收本科为非经济、管理、金融类专业的理工科学生申请。</span></span></p></section><section><strong><span>06</span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>新闻与传播项目（财经传媒方向）：</span></strong></span><span><span>申请人须对财经传媒有浓厚兴趣，且为新闻传播或其他人文社科类专业的本科生，中文写作和英语能力较好，并善于学习和吸收不同学科的知识。</span></span></p></section><section><strong><span>07</span></strong></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fG8tKiaDWlNG631jK6BVP5830A5e7h1cIW6j9qpMThKqa8yHKtMo1AuAZZKibWVxQj6fsH4GFTWYCbSpVic7XMSeg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"